This question probes ownership, bias for action, and customer obsession under pressure with a high-stakes customer.

## Key Concepts
- Incident command and clear ownership
- Metrics-driven triage and customer impact assessment
- Safe rollout patterns: canaries, feature flags, circuit breakers
- Customer communication and trade-off framing

